# v1.1.0
## Major
- Implemented PDF region scanning to better select regions
- Updated table design
- Auto Catagory Rules implemented.
- Removed the vestigial "New Catagory" rule type — page rules now create the journal and category automatically. Existing "New Catagory" rules are auto-converted to "New Page" on load.
- Added a badge that shows what rule is being applied to what results to assist with troubleshooting
- Fixed drag-and-drop rule reordering becoming progressively slower over a long editing session (duplicate drag listeners were being added on every tree refresh).

## Minor
- Added a welcome message for GMs with links to the wiki, Discord, and Patreon, plus a "do not show again" option.
- Disabled "load Rules" functionality before PDF is loaded to prevent order of operations issues with fonts.

- Fixed "New Section" rules not showing their type badge in the rules tree.


# v1.0.2


## minor

- Fixed some matching rules to improve accuracy of matches
- Fixed bug that was causing "New Catagory" rule to render incorrectly.
- Fixed bug that was causing default Header level to be "2" instead of "1"
